(4.2  Solving Equations) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 740 Tm
(To solve a linear equation we perform the same operation) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 720 Tm
(on both sides until the variable stands alone.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 700 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 60 680 Tm
(Rules:) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 660 Tm
(  1. Add or subtract the same number on both sides.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 640 Tm
(  2. Multiply or divide both sides by the same non-zero number.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 620 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 60 600 Tm
(Example 2:  Solve  2\(x - 3\) = 10) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 580 Tm
(            2x - 6 = 10) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 560 Tm
(            2x = 16) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 540 Tm
(             x = 8) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 520 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 60 500 Tm
(Check:  2\(8 - 3\) = 2\(5\) = 10   Correct.) Tj
ET
endstream
