1 0 0 1 60 680 Tm
(Example 3:) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 660 Tm
(The sum of two consecutive numbers is 47. Find them.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 640 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 60 620 Tm
(   Let the first number be x.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 600 Tm
(   Then the next number is x + 1.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 580 Tm
(   x + \(x + 1\) = 47) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 560 Tm
(   2x + 1 = 47) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 540 Tm
(   2x = 46) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 520 Tm
(   x = 23) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 500 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 60 480 Tm
(The numbers are 23 and 24.) Tj
