(4.5  Summary) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 740 Tm
(Key points from this chapter:) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 720 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 60 700 Tm
(  - A linear equation has the form ax + b = 0.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 680 Tm
(  - The highest power of the variable is 1.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 660 Tm
(  - Whatever is done to one side must be done to the other.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 640 Tm
(  - Always verify the answer by substitution.) Tj
1 0 0 1 60 620 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 60 600 Tm
(Next chapter: Linear Equations in Two Variables.) Tj
